  Description: "Usage worn bracers These lovely armbands sparkle and gleam, reflecting
    your own incredible magnetism. Immanence (aura, mental) Others find it hard to
    leave your captivating presence. An aura surrounds you in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10].
    An enemy in the aura that attempts to move away from you must succeed at a @Check[will|against:class]
    save against your class DC or its move action is disrupted. Transcendence\u2014
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Embrace of Destiny] 1 (mental, spirit,
    transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.V4HToYPQlkw8AW50 inline]"
